@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "Game HTTP caller" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "GameController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "GameSessionService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "GameSessionRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "GameSession / TelemetryEvent / CoordinationResult" as P4 <<entity>>
P0 -> P1: Submit session results
P1 -> P2: Validate final results
note over P2,P4: Authorize and validate the batch before starting the transaction.
P2 -> P3: Start the transaction
P2 -> P3: Ensure player and session exist
P2 -> P3: Lock and read known events
P3 --> P2: Return stored identities
alt same identity and consistent final outcome
P2 -> P4: Prepare new session data
P2 -> P3: Save accepted data
P3 --> P2: Confirm the commit
P2 --> P1: Return ingestion counts
P1 --> P0: Record the upload result
else ownership or final outcome conflicts
P2 --> P1: Reject the update
P1 --> P0: Display the conflict
end
@enduml